# Echo

> A terminal AI coding assistant with a beautiful TUI — chat, code, and explore with any AI model.

![Python Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.10%2B-blue)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green)
![CLI](https://img.shields.io/badge/CLI-Textual%20TUI-orange)

---

Echo is a terminal-based AI coding assistant that brings the power of AI models directly into your terminal. With a beautiful Textual TUI, it supports multiple AI providers, context-aware conversations, and seamless file operations.

## Quick Start

```bash
pip install echo-chat

# Start chatting
echo

# With a specific model
echo --provider openai --model gpt-4o

# One-shot query
echo "explain this codebase"
```

## Features

- **Beautiful TUI** — Textual-powered terminal UI with syntax highlighting
- **Multi-model** — OpenAI, DeepSeek, Claude, Gemini, Ollama, and more
- **Context-aware** — Reads your project files for informed answers
- **Session history** — Save and resume conversations
- **Code highlighting** — Pygments-powered syntax highlighting
- **Streaming** — Real-time token streaming

## Configuration

```bash
echo config set ai.api_key sk-xxx
echo config set ai.provider openai
echo config set ai.model gpt-4o
```

